tml":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>8</span><span>313</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>26</span><span>331</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ACA}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{ACA}_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}\">\\(\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TIdeal}\">\\(\\mathsf{TIdeal}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf J\">\\(\\mathsf J\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35af454d9caa8c9d\" href=\"?note=35af454d9caa8c9d\" title=\"62-df-ACA0\">62-df-ACA0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" href=\"?note=5ed7a378ff9d39c6\" title=\"62-df-omega-model\">62-df-omega-model</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0efbe3f2d5d172f3\" href=\"?note=0efbe3f2d5d172f3\" title=\"62-df-turing-ideal\">62-df-turing-ideal</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d4d648cbb987de36\" href=\"?note=d4d648cbb987de36\" title=\"62-df-jump-operator\">62-df-jump-operator</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ACA0\\text{-}omega\\text{-}models}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S},\\mathrm{ACA}_0)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{TIdeal}(\\mathcal S)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal S\\;(\\mathsf J(A)\\in\\mathcal S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ACA0\\text{-}omega\\text{-}models}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S},\\mathrm{ACA}_0)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{TIdeal}(\\mathcal S)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal S\\;(\\mathsf J(A)\\in\\mathcal S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向由算术理解得到相对停机集合。反向由有限 join 汇总参数，再做有限次跳跃，判定任意固定的算术公式，最后用归约向下闭包取得其定义集。原文的 TJ 与对角 J 具有均匀相对 Turing 等价，故刻画不受有效编号差异影响。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Remark I.3.4; Theorem VIII.1.10; Exercise VIII.1.12；纸面页 8, 313；PDF 页 26, 331。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-ACA0","status":"resolved","id":"35af454d9caa8c9d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ACA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-omega-model","status":"resolved","id":"5ed7a378ff9d39c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-omega-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-turing-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"0efbe3f2d5d172f3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-turing-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"d4d648cbb987de36","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ACA0","status":"resolved","id":"35af454d9caa8c9d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$；$\\mathrm{ACA}_0$、$\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}$、$\\mathsf{TIdeal}$、$\\mathsf J$ 见 [[62-df-ACA0]]、[[62-df-omega-model]]、[[62-df-turing-ideal]]、[[62-df-jump-operator]]。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-omega-model","status":"resolved","id":"5ed7a378ff9d39c6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$；$\\mathrm{ACA}_0$、$\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}$、$\\mathsf{TIdeal}$、$\\mathsf J$ 见 [[62